      "narration_text": "In Godot, make two spheres: one unshaded with a highlight painted into its texture, and one with a Standard Material 3D. Predict what happens to each as you rotate a directional light all the way round. Then remove the sky and look at a metal sphere. Check two things: Only the PBR highlight follows the light. The metal needs something to reflect.",
